The proposed answer overlooks the possibility that \(B\) is obtuse. Besides \(BC=10\), the angle \(B=180^\circ-\sin^{-1}(4/5)\) gives \(BC=14/5\).

Thus the sum is \(10+14/5=64/5\), which is option C.

