The solution missed a factor pair. 351 = 3³·13, whose divisors are 1, 3, 9, 13, 27, 39, 117, 351. The pair (13, 27) was omitted, giving n = 13 + 27 − 7 = 33. Check: 33² + 14·33 − 1355 = 1089 + 462 − 1355 = 196 = 14². ✓

So the valid n are 345, 113, 41, and 33, summing to 345 + 113 + 41 + 33 = 532, which matches option B, not C.

